<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dutch first</p>
<p>division soccer played on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Feyenoord Rotterdam 3 (Koeman 13th penalty, Taument</p>
<p>56th, Sanchez 59th) Groningen 1 (Magno 50th). Halftime 1-0.</p>
<p>Attendance 23,306.</p>
<p>Ajax Amsterdam 3 (Scholten 18th, Babangida 23rd, Musampa 28th)</p>
<p>Willem II Tilburg 0. Halftime 3-0. Attendance 47,154.</p>
<p>AZ Alkmaaar 1 (Kooyman 90th) Sparta Rotterdam 2 (Dennis de</p>
<p>Nooyer 41st, Renfurm 84th). Halftime 0-1. Attendance 6,956. </p>
<p>Vitesse Arnhem 1 (Jochemsen 41st) Roda JC Kerkrade 2 (Sibon</p>
<p>7th, 75th). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 5,959.</p>
<p>NEC Nijmegen 1 (Koning 65th) Heerenveen 1 (Straal 78th).</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance 3,269.</p>
<p>RKC Waalwijk 0 Volendam 0. Attendance 4,000.</p>
<p>NAC Breda 3 (Arnold 21st, Scheepers 40th, Van Galen</p>
<p>60th) Utrecht 3 (Van Loen 47th, Mols 57th, Van Nieuwkerk 90th).</p>
<p>Halftime 2-0. Attendance 11,450.</p>
<p>Played on Tuesday:</p>
<p>PSV Eindhoven 2 (Cocu 57th, Zenden 84th) Twente Enschede 0.</p>
<p>Halftime 0-0. Attendance 26,800.</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 0 Graafschap 3 (Victoria 55th, Breetveld 74th,</p>
<p>Viscaal 82nd). Halftime 0-0. Attendance 3,500.</p>
